# IMO 2009 P6 three-phase absorb runner audit checklist

- [ ] Treat this as a live side-effecting development runner, not an offline unit test.
- [ ] Require current user authorization before DB, tmux, Devin, model or runtime-output actions.
- [ ] Load only the canonical in-repo fixture; do not depend on retired `subagents-dirs/` content.
- [ ] Preserve four-version grading, program enumeration, synthesis and partial-failure semantics.
- [ ] Keep runtime workspace/log/archive outputs outside current stable knowledge authorities.
